    "Transcript_Log": "Agent: Good Morning, Thank you for calling Duroflex. My name is Ananthu, how may I assist you?\nCustomer: Hello, is this the Duroflex Kottayam showroom?\nAgent: Yes sir, tell me.\nCustomer: Is the Livin Pocket Spring mattress 8-inch available there?\nAgent: Which one sir? Pocket Spring mattress is available.\nCustomer: 8-inch thickness. Pocket Spring model coming in the Livin series. Do you have it in store?\nAgent: 8-inch thickness Pocket Spring models are available in store. We can experience it. We can deliver it from the depot.\nCustomer: What is the rate coming for that?\nAgent: What are the exact dimensions you are looking for sir?\nCustomer: Queen Size, 8 inch.\nAgent: Queen size has variations sir. 72x60, 75x60, and 78x60.\nCustomer: 72x60.\nAgent: 72x60. One minute sir, let me check the price. (Pause/Typing sound). For the Propel Plus model, the MRP is 25,613. In offer, it comes to 22,280.\nCustomer: Oh, okay. With pillows, mattress protection cover, and free delivery?\nAgent: Yes, with pillows, protection cover, and free delivery.\nCustomer: Is there a difference between your online site and the showroom?\nAgent: No sir. For the Propel Plus model, the price I quoted is the same online.\nCustomer: No, I meant my model. I asked about 'Livin'.\nAgent: Oh, Livin! Livin category Pocket Spring is what you asked. One minute sir. (Pause). Livin is actually an online-focused model. We don't usually keep display stock of it. It takes about 7 days for delivery.\nCustomer: What about the 'Bounce' model?\nAgent: Bounce... (Checking). That comes to 15,049.\nCustomer: Is that the final price?\nAgent: Yes, 15,049. I can add pillows and protection cover as a gift with that.\nCustomer: Okay. Actually, my friend works at Duroflex Bangalore. His name is Jomy. He said he can arrange an employee discount.\nAgent: Is it? Okay. I don't know him personally, but if he is an employee, there is a discount scheme.\nCustomer: He said he will call the showroom. If he calls, can you give that price?\nAgent: Yes, if he calls and provides the details, we can work it out.\nCustomer: How much would the price be then?\nAgent: If the employee discount is applied... it usually comes down to around 17k range (for the higher model) or significant reduction. It depends on the specific approval.\nCustomer: Okay, my name is Suresh. I will ask him to call you.\nAgent: Okay Suresh sir. I have noted it. If he calls, we will proceed.\nCustomer: Thank you.\nAgent: Thank you."
}

