he discounted rate is 20,877.\nCustomer: Okay. That is fine. I am unwell, I have a fever. That's why my voice is like this.\nAgent: Oh, take care.\nCustomer: So, I want to pay. Can I pay via Google Pay?\nAgent: Yes, you can.\nCustomer: Send me the scanner. I will pay now. But I need it delivered.\nAgent: I need to check if the stock is available at the Pantheerankavu godown. If it is there, we can deliver.\nCustomer: Please check. I want to pay immediately.\nAgent: Okay, I will check the stock at Pantheerankavu and call you back right now. If it's there, I will send the scanner to your WhatsApp.\nCustomer: Okay, please check and call back. My number has WhatsApp.\nAgent: Okay, thank you."
