    "Transcript_Log": "Agent: Good afternoon, thank you for calling Duroflex.\nCustomer: Yeah good afternoon, is this Kondapur?\nAgent: Yes sir, Hi sir.\nCustomer: Yes sir, Kondapur.\nAgent: One minute, I am speaking from Duroflex.\nCustomer: Yes sir.\nAgent: Do you speak Telugu?\nCustomer: Yes, I speak. Tell me.\nCustomer: You have the Strength model in Duroflex, right?\nAgent: Strength Coir mattress, Orthopedic mattress sir, yes.\nCustomer: Strength model is there, right?\nAgent: Yes sir, yes sir.\nCustomer: 7 inches... Strength 7 inches... I need one King size and one 72x36. Two needed. One King size, one 72x36.\nAgent: Okay sir. Okay sir. So what is the cost?\nCustomer: One second sir.\nAgent: Strength King size... what is the size sir?\nCustomer: 78x72.\nAgent: 78x72. And single is 72x36 or 78x36?\nCustomer: 72x36.\nAgent: Two quantity.\nCustomer: Ah, one of that, one of this.\n(Pause for calculation)\nAgent: Sir actually for both combined MRP is 61,628 rupees sir.\nCustomer: 61,628 rupees.\nAgent: Okay. And after discount, it becomes 48,255 rupees sir.\nCustomer: 48,000?\nAgent: Yes sir.\nCustomer: How much is the discount? 10%?\nAgent: Not 10 sir, on 65k it is almost 22-23% discount.\nCustomer: But I asked in another shop, for Strength model 78x72 7 inches, it was 36,000.\nAgent: Sir, individually if I say... 42,166 is MRP. Online price is 36,685. On top of online price, I am giving additional 10% discount. The final price I give is 33,017 rupees. Only for 78x72 7 inches Strength mattress.\nCustomer: 33,017 rupees?\nAgent: 17 rupees sir.\nCustomer: 10% on that?\nAgent: Additionally on online price you get 12%, on top of that I am giving additional 10% from store side. Total overall 22%.\nCustomer: Okay okay. So final price is 33,000?\nAgent: 33,000 sir.\nCustomer: Okay, and that 72x36?\nAgent: That comes to 15,239 rupees sir.\nCustomer: 15,239. Okay okay.\nCustomer: Is this final? Any other offers?\nAgent: No sir, this is final price. And on this, do you have any credit cards?\nCustomer: HDFC is there.\nAgent: If HDFC, for some cards there is No Cost EMI. If you convert to No Cost EMI, you get 5% instant discount sir.\nCustomer: Okay okay.\nAgent: You have to convert to EMI, No Cost EMI, no interest. If you convert, you get 5% instant discount. 3 months or 6 months depending on card.\nCustomer: Okay okay. And delivery charges?\nAgent: No delivery charges, free delivery. And along with this, until the 19th there is a Lucky Draw running. If you purchase value over 50,000... our limit is 50,000... in Lucky Draw if you win, you get that amount back as token amount to buy other products.\nCustomer: When will you draw? 19th?\nAgent: 19th or 20th. In AP/Telangana only one lottery.\nCustomer: Oh okay okay. Only one.\nCustomer: Along with this any pillows or Sankranti offers?\nAgent: Sir direct additional overall 22% discount, delivery free, card offers... all are there sir.\nCustomer: What is the warranty?\nAgent: 7 years warranty sir. In warranty, if sagging is more than 1.5 inch, you can claim. Within one year piece to piece replacement. Remaining years pro-rata basis.\nCustomer: Is there memory foam? 1 inch or half inch?\nAgent: In this, I will tell layer wise. 3 layers... First layer Coir, second HR foam, third Coir, fourth Rebonded foam, fifth Coir. All hard surface. On top of this, Dual Density 5 Zone Orthopedic Layer is there. It takes position based on body weight... neck, shoulder, hips, legs. On top of that 1 inch quilting memory foam is there. It fills gaps when you sleep and improves blood circulation.\nCustomer: Spinal Care and others... is there difference with other companies?\nAgent: 100% difference sir. Ours has 5 Zone Orthopedic layer certification.\nCustomer: Fine. I will come in the evening.\nAgent: Do you have location idea sir?\nCustomer: I have idea.\nAgent: Okay sir. I will be at store. Night 9:30-10 I will be there.\nCustomer: Done done.\nAgent: Thank you sir."
