 any credit cards?\nCustomer: HDFC is there.\nAgent: If HDFC, for some cards there is No Cost EMI. If you convert to No Cost EMI, you get 5% instant discount sir.\nCustomer: Okay okay.\nAgent: You have to convert to EMI, No Cost EMI, no interest. If you convert, you get 5% instant discount. 3 months or 6 months depending on card.\nCustomer: Okay okay. And delivery charges?\nAgent: No delivery charges, free delivery. And along with this, until the 19th there is a Lucky Draw running. If you purchase value over 50,000... our limit is 50,000... in Lucky Draw if you win, you get that amount back as token amount to buy other products.\nCustomer: When will you draw? 19th?\nAgent: 19th or 20th. In AP/Telangana only one lottery.\nCustomer: Oh okay okay. Only one.\nCustomer: Along with this any pillows or Sankranti offers?\nAgent: Sir direct additional overall 22% discount, delivery free, card offers... all are there sir.\nCustomer: What is the warranty?\nAgent: 7 years warranty sir. In warranty, if sagging is more than 1.5 inch, you can claim. Within one year piece to piece replacement. Remaining years pro-rata basis.\nCustomer: Is there memory foam? 1 inch or half inch?\nAgent: In this, I will tell layer wise. 3 layers... First layer Coir, second HR foam, third Coir, fourth Rebonded foam, fifth Coir. All hard surface. On top of this, Dual Density 5 Zone Orthopedic Layer is there. It takes position based on body weight... neck, shoulder, hips, legs. On top of that 1 inch quilting memory foam is there. It fills gaps when you sleep and improves blood circulation.\nCustomer: Spinal Care and others... is there difference with other companies?\nAgent: 100% difference sir. Ours has 5 Zone Orthopedic layer certification.\nCustomer: Fine. I will come in the evening.\nAgent: Do you have location idea sir?\nCustomer: I have idea.\nAgent: Okay sir. I will be at store. Night 9:30-10 I will be there.\nCustomer: Done done.\nAgent: Thank you sir."
