al kar paoon. Aap mujhe contact number de sakte hain sir? (Yes sir, so I can make the best deal with you. Can you give me contact number sir?)\nCustomer: Main deta hoon... likh lijiye. (I will give... write it down.) 8147203252.\nAgent: 8147203252?\nCustomer: Correct.\nAgent: Okay? Sir maine WhatsApp pe Hi karke bheja hai. Main aapko subah contact karunga sir aapko poora detail de dunga. (Sir I have sent Hi on WhatsApp. I will contact you in the morning and give full details.)\nCustomer: Theek hai sir. Okay thank you."
