wat aapke King size ki 10,000 rupay se bhi hai hamare paas. (Yes, otherwise for King size we have starting from 10,000 rupees also.)\nCustomer: Ji, theek. (Yes, okay.)\nAgent: Ji. Toh aap ek baar aake experience kar lijiye, visit kar lijiye. Phir aap jo bhi order karna chahein, apne convenience ke according order kar dijiyega. (Yes. So please come and experience it once, visit. Then whatever you want to order, you can order according to your convenience.)\nCustomer: Theek, theek. (Okay, okay.)\nAgent: Okay, toh kab tak visit karenge? (Okay, so by when will you visit?)\nCustomer: Abhi dekhiye aadhe ghante mein. (See, in half an hour.)\nAgent: Okay sir, main aapko message drop kar raha hoon, location usme mil jayegi aapko. Usko aap Google se drive karke aa sakte hain. (Okay sir, I am dropping a message, you will get the location in it. You can drive via Google using that.)\nCustomer: Theek, theek. (Okay, okay.)\nAgent: Okay sir. Thank you for calling Duroflex."
