h... Yeah.\nCustomer: Okay. Okay, I'll come down to the store. You are direct Duroflex no? You are not a dealer?\nAgent: Yeah, yeah. No, this is direct Duroflex Exclusive Store. And we have launched new mattress is there, that one is like Airbus series. You can visit our store ma'am, we will show you all the models.\nCustomer: I'll reach by another half an hour or so, okay?\nAgent: Sure, sure ma'am. Take your own time.\nCustomer: What's your name?\nAgent: My name is Niyamat ma'am.\nCustomer: Niyamat?\nAgent: Niyamat. N-I-Y-A-M-A-T.\nCustomer: Okay fine. Thank you so much. I'll come down and confirm which one I want, okay?\nAgent: Sure ma'am.\nCustomer: Thank you.\nAgent: Thank you ma'am."
