ion mat lijiye sir. We will... aapka agar wo tuta hai... hum change karwa denge. Aap tension mat lijiye. Agar wo tuta hai toh we will change it. Main unko force karke change karwayenge.\nCustomer: Aap bhejiye mujhe bhejiye email ID.\nAgent: Ji ji. Ji main bhejta hu. Okay."
